Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:03.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}生旅雅虎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:03.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs50}（應該是指親臨現場的那種觀光節目，但也能理解成人生之旅）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.36,0:00:06.22,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是什麼特集呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.63,0:00:12.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴上次和阿翼一起看那個恐龍特集 非常投入呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:13.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.62,0:00:15.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:16.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:19.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來 阿翼他人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:24.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 他好像在閱讀藍天大地的國王送過來的書
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:24.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Skyland
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:32.17,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.84,0:00:36.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 我們去下面房間玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:37.81,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:42.34,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.07,0:00:49.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼他好像有想要研究的東西 最近很熱衷學習
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.65,0:00:51.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 太可靠了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.89,0:00:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這週的特集是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.75,0:00:56.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結婚儀式！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.31,0:00:58.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 結婚儀式啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.86,0:01:02.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,新娘子的婚紗真漂亮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:06.59,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:10.20,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.37,0:01:13.14,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 小空興趣濃厚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:14.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好美麗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.11,0:01:22.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這邊世界的結婚儀式太閃亮了 真浪漫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.34,0:01:26.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？藍天大地的結婚儀式是不是跟這裡不一樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.24,0:01:29.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 比如在我們村
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:36.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是新郎和新娘 先用全村都能聽到的音量 大聲吶喊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.96,0:01:38.21,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.54,0:01:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好 我們結婚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:47.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,聞聲而來的村民們就集合起來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:51.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,跳一整晚的舞來慶祝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.71,0:01:53.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這種的也很有趣啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.07,0:01:56.08,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,結婚 是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.51,0:02:01.55,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 結婚啊 就是彼此喜歡的兩個人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.78,0:02:06.79,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,約定以後都永遠要好 吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:08.24,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.14,0:02:16.92,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.21,0:02:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜你們
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.62,0:02:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.35,0:02:27.60,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空要和翼結婚！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.82,0:02:29.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.25,0:02:30.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.33,0:02:32.05,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,要結婚！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.26,0:02:33.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.14,0:04:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}要好♡\N小空結婚儀式☆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.97,0:04:17.20,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我和公...公主結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.58,0:04:18.95,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,結婚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.24,0:04:22.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,因為小空很喜歡阿翼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.29,0:04:25.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 不過現在結婚還太早了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:26.77,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.36,0:04:30.02,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主這份心 我是很榮幸的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:35.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我來當公主的結婚對象... 實在是誠惶誠恐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:38.01,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 就要結婚！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.67,0:04:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新郎新娘就要攜手切開蛋糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.35,0:04:46.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇... 好大的蛋糕啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:52.00,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對對 大到必須新郎新娘一起切開
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.64,0:04:53.85,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.01,0:04:54.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.02,0:05:01.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空是不是也想穿上那麼漂亮的禮服 再享受美味的蛋糕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.81,0:05:03.56,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,禮服和蛋糕？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:08.59,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這個我懂 我小時候也有模仿過結婚儀式
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.99,0:05:11.08,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.28,0:05:15.56,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼就不是結婚儀式 而是辦一個模仿派對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:20.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想體驗一下這邊世界的結婚儀式！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:23.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們就玩一次結婚儀式遊戲吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.81,0:05:25.30,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這個主意很有趣呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.67,0:05:27.25,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,少年同意的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.56,0:05:30.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 只要公主高興
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.73,0:05:33.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:34.87,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:37.31,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上開始準備！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:51.78,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 少年讀書很賣力呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.36,0:05:56.12,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這本上記載了很多見所未見的天空石
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.36,0:05:56.12,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1380,960)}Sky Jewel
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:06:00.02,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,只要認真學習 就能為國效力的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.41,0:06:06.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,離蛋糕出爐還有一點時間 阿翼你就繼續看書吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.77,0:06:09.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我這邊的準備也快要完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.45,0:06:11.83,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.06,0:06:14.65,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就恭敬不如從命 繼續讀書了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.87,0:06:20.52,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.75,0:06:31.25,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 等結婚儀式準備好了 阿翼就會回來的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:35.56,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.39,0:06:42.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空真可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:46.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,唔 少年 放鬆 放鬆！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.47,0:06:49.52,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,能... 能不能別讓我更緊張
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.03,0:06:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空和阿翼弟弟啊 能夠發誓
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以後也不放棄彼此喜歡的感情嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.51,0:07:01.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,當然不會！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.73,0:07:03.49,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,永遠要好！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:10.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都站好了 再靠近一點
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.31,0:07:14.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好 大伙一起來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:15.51,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,飛揚！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（快門聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.71,0:07:35.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好美妙的結婚儀式啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:38.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！讓我想要按照藍天大地的習俗 一直跳到早上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.25,0:07:40.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.59,0:07:42.68,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我們也該收拾收拾了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.91,0:07:44.04,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:44.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.82,0:07:45.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.63,0:07:46.66,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:49.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.39,0:07:50.87,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,結婚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.03,0:07:51.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.99,0:07:52.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.01,0:07:54.15,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.33,0:07:57.88,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,結婚了 就要永遠在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.13,0:08:02.43,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,結婚 我們這不是模仿結婚儀式的派對嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.62,0:08:03.82,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:10.04,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,難道是當真認為這是真的結婚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.24,0:08:11.37,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.54,0:08:14.11,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.64,0:08:22.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到 公主居然是當真的...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.75,0:08:24.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我也能理解小空的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:29.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,因為電視上的新娘子很幸福啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.49,0:08:30.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:37.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,只要睡一晚 小空的結婚儀式也會結束的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.33,0:08:38.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧 小蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.97,0:08:48.10,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.11,0:08:49.16,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:54.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 沒什麼 小空可太可愛了 有點神魂顛倒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.55,0:08:57.16,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這一點是不需要有疑問...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.38,0:09:07.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結.... 結結... 結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.35,0:09:12.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我那可愛無比的小空公主居然出嫁了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.98,0:09:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你覺得我會同意嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:18.40,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,呀... 不是的... 聽我說...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.61,0:09:26.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最重要的是 你有肩負起藍天大地的王的覺悟嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.53,0:09:28.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,覺悟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 你怎麼又闖大禍了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:35.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白的 我能理解你的想法 小翼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:38.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是媽媽覺得現在就結婚還是太早了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.15,0:09:42.04,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的 你們聽我說啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:46.67,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空和翼結婚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.93,0:09:52.65,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.71,0:09:56.56,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚 嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.91,0:10:01.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我能挑起的擔子...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.24,0:00:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.22,0:10:16.97,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,起來 阿翼 起來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.35,0:10:20.59,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:23.40,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.11,0:10:38.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 睡了個懶覺
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.77,0:10:39.82,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.49,0:10:43.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,沒了！書沒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:44.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.15,0:10:48.77,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有了 國王陛下給我的寶貴的書
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:50.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.48,0:10:53.12,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我記得 昨天是放在這椅子上的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:55.50,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 之後再沒有動過
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:10:58.41,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 大伙分頭找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:10:59.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(280,1060)}是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:10:59.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(680,1060)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.47,0:11:02.17,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,麻煩大伙了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:11.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 沒有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.48,0:11:15.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,少年 你是不是起夜迷糊了 把書放到二樓房間裡去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.19,0:11:17.60,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不會 沒這種事的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.97,0:11:18.85,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.05,0:11:23.60,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,吵到你了啊 公主 我們正在找東西...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.21,0:11:28.46,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 公主有見到過放在椅子上的書嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.89,0:11:29.92,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.93,0:11:33.70,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是國王陛下給我的書
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.87,0:11:36.36,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 不知道什麼書！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.72,0:11:38.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？小空 這個是！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.24,0:11:41.05,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,才沒有藏起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.21,0:11:42.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.17,0:11:46.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主！你不要跑啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.23,0:11:47.07,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不要不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.39,0:11:50.63,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:53.15,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不要！不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.48,0:11:56.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想是被小空拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.03,0:12:03.30,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啊... 那是對我很寶貴的書
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.59,0:12:04.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,請還給我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.27,0:12:07.90,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,翼... 寶貴的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.09,0:12:11.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是非常非常寶貴！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:14.10,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,噗...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.84,0:12:17.06,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:19.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.82,0:12:20.46,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:21.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:23.75,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,超討厭 翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.96,0:12:25.13,CureMaj,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs70}超討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.38,0:12:26.63,CureMaj,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs60}超討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:28.25,CureMaj,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs50}超討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.15,0:12:28.16,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:31.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.99,0:12:35.35,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.53,0:12:40.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天才玩的結婚儀式遊戲 今天就被討厭了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.79,0:12:43.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,莫名其妙的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.33,0:12:45.37,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你是完全不懂呢 少年
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:47.65,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,反正我就是個少年
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.83,0:12:50.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我問你 你覺得小空為什麼要把書藏起來？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.22,0:12:55.02,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼 嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.08,0:12:59.47,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你最近挺帥的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.69,0:13:00.57,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:02.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,拚了命的學習
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.72,0:13:05.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,向著自己的目標勇往直前
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.89,0:13:08.41,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝誇張
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:11.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空就有點孤單了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.74,0:13:12.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:19.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是感覺到 一直陪著自己玩的阿翼在漸漸遠離？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.54,0:13:23.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.74,0:13:25.04,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.55,0:13:28.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧 少年
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:30.69,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶華姐...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.90,0:13:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（鐘聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:43.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噼噼噼 噼噼噼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.14,0:13:53.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}《熊孩子》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:55.58,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空好無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:56.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.10,0:13:59.41,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更要好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:02.57,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:04.70,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,永遠要好！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:08.36,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才想要結婚...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.86,0:14:11.87,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,但我卻根本沒有察覺到...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.61,0:14:16.60,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.79,0:14:18.70,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.88,0:14:19.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.45,0:14:22.77,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你感受孤單了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:25.28,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,翼...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.47,0:14:26.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咕咕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.37,0:14:31.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咕咕 咕咕 咕咕！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.70,0:14:33.47,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,難道是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.33,0:14:38.63,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,一人之下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.21,0:14:47.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量 召喚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.97,0:14:57.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.32,0:14:59.09,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.28,0:15:00.42,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我們上吧！
